 > > *(c) urges the Government to explore a fairer system for fines that would reduce penalty amounts for those on Commonwealth income support, and increase penalty amounts for those earning over $180,000 a year”.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-9199","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-10-10/7"}
